; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DNS-AID — DNS for AI Discovery records for luongnv.com   (bettersite #36)
; Guide: https://isitagentready.com/.well-known/agent-skills/dns-aid/SKILL.md
;
; DNS-AID publishes ServiceMode SVCB/HTTPS records under the `_agents`
; namespace so agents can discover a domain's agent endpoints through DNS.
; These records live in the luongnv.com DNS zone — outside this repo's deploy
; scope (bettersite.luongnv.com on GitHub Pages). The owner creates them at the DNS
; provider (Cloudflare: DNS → Records → Add record, type "HTTPS").
;
; Endpoint being advertised: the luongnv.com origin itself, which serves the
; agent-facing discovery surface over HTTP/2 on port 443:
;   /llms.txt  /.well-known/ai-catalog.json  /auth.md
; plus BetterSite's own host, bettersite.luongnv.com:
;   /llms.txt  /auth.md  /{,fr/}index.md  /.well-known/oauth-protected-resource
;
; TTL 300 during rollout; raise to 3600 once verified. Enable DNSSEC on the
; zone — the guide recommends signed discovery zones.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

; Agent index endpoint — the origin's machine-readable catalog.
; HTTPS 1 = ServiceMode priority; target luongnv.com. = connection host;
; alpn="h2" port=443 = how to reach it; mandatory pins both params.
_index._agents.luongnv.com.       300 IN HTTPS 1 luongnv.com. alpn="h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port

; BetterSite — its own host; discovery documents live at the root of
; bettersite.luongnv.com (llms.txt, auth.md, markdown mirrors, OAuth PRM).
_bettersite._agents.luongnv.com.  300 IN HTTPS 1 bettersite.luongnv.com. alpn="h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port
